583
00:43:02,126 --> 00:43:07,140
The open loop I promised you. Both of these models can work in the background while you keep talking.

584
00:43:07,630 --> 00:43:11,940
In the old days, you'd ask AI to do something and everything would freeze while it worked.

585
00:43:12,384 --> 00:43:15,716
