586
00:43:16,238 --> 00:43:17,424
Google flipped that around.

587
00:43:17,646 --> 00:43:25,540
Now the model can say something like, let me check that, and go do the task in the background while it keeps chatting with you, even narrating its progress out loud.

588
00:43:25,966 --> 00:43:29,956
So you can ask a follow-up or change your mind while it's still working on the first thing.

589
00:43:30,318 --> 00:43:32,164
The conversation never stops dead.

590
00:43:32,622 --> 00:43:38,064
That's the big shift, and it's exactly why this feels so different, and it's not stuck in one language either.

