00:45:30,158 --> 00:45:42,756
On tougher agent tasks, it hit 68.6% on a benchmark called Tau Voice, and 35.1% on a banking version of that same test, which copies a real customer calling a bank and needing multi-step help.

610
00:45:43,150 --> 00:45:51,588
And the faster model, plain Gemini 3.8 Live, came in second place in the speech agent arena, where real people pick which voice AI they liked best.

