1228
01:35:28,782 --> 01:35:36,672
Now instead of scrolling through a giant list, you get cards you can actually scan in two seconds. You instantly see what's low, what's full, and what needs attention.

1229
01:35:36,832 --> 01:35:38,192
That's the whole point of this tool.

1230
01:35:38,432 --> 01:35:43,072
It takes information you already have and it makes it something your brain can actually process quickly.

