The habit is.

1838
02:20:22,062 --> 02:20:26,852
An AI assistant, one key press away, only helps if you actually press the key.

1839
02:20:27,150 --> 02:20:30,016
And that brings me to the last two things I want to leave you with.

1840
02:20:30,222 --> 02:20:35,296
Getting faster at writing and research is great, but it only counts if the right people find what you publish.

1841
02:20:35,662 --> 02:20:41,764
Gemini living on desktops all over the world means more people asking AI questions instead of scrolling search results.

1842
02:20:41,856 --> 02:20:45,924
And whether your brand shows up in those answers is something you can actually work on.

1843
