2448
03:10:25,614 --> 03:10:27,984
There's one important thing to understand about the output though.

2449
03:10:28,206 --> 03:10:34,212
The infographic comes out as a static PNG image. It's a generation tool, not an image editor.

2450
03:10:34,414 --> 03:10:40,260
So inside the notebook, you can't fix a small typo, you can't move a block around, and you can't drop in your own logo.

2451
03:10:40,494 --> 03:10:47,424
If you need to make those kinds of edits, the move is to pull the PNG into a design tool like Canva and clean it up there.

2452
03:10:47,504 --> 03:10:57,184
A quick pro tip for that, if you know you're going to edit it later, ask for a plain white background in your prompt. Editing tools handle a clean white background way better than a busy textured one.

2453
03:10:57,264 --> 03:10:59,104
So your cleanup goes a lot smoother.

2454
03:10:59,310 --> 03:11:05,252
Here's my advice for the infographic. If you're planning to share it on social media, use the concise setting.

2455
03:11:05,424 --> 03:11:11,424
It cuts down the text and gives you a cleaner, easier to read image that people can actually absorb while scrolling.

2456
03:11:11,598 --> 03:11:16,900
